": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zg-sMqEM8WAQ7kNvwGNeAtK&_nc_oc=AdqNCZFVLbc0rZuRoMxovYk55eLKTko65p4BA8OpvqLK7Mb2aXpAWLCN6SgnZvfEZ2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJaOdbazvombCnNvdEsyWzWZGLcOrkN6E2klHbfdyX0A&oe=6A9AD997"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4TqVNXrAWfwQ7kNvwGl8_ua&_nc_oc=AdoZ-zlE-NFejFWgcTWwSLkrO29j4XlQNSNw1ZkpYU_2fk9Yz12BJqRNIac_vuASHRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLUzI9gwYbfJhjgLBUK3Ql41Q--_AHVss7ExvKxoupiyQ&oe=6A9AE38B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X5YzaW7Y484Q7kNvwEKi5wY&_nc_oc=AdrKM-5PePCJVd3_ECRZUXdgCpQnbxBNS4NvsFAtsKO556_pl6jStE6QspzjYFizm8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKcGJCrEMiG4arfPrA_ANBUGg_7vDkon5wPEhlpjHh52A&oe=6A9AE48E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1af2g_FF6OAQ7kNvwEcS4JT&_nc_oc=AdooGB34tJECmymk0i348tgqEJEd3dd4OlnEWqcARqWbAJ1m5J4bw1Pp7B2kqRHYPKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLzPDpUswmUSzsewCE5gq9F938vKcEoOdlpNkiLCuvZUg&oe=6A9ACDB6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YBSEK7dMT4gQ7kNvwFPwTZe&_nc_oc=AdpctsQg7k6hpi7Cy-rcDn0bYB9QBEu5KomqyWQSzNpyClbzy5WQGZS4MtEY8vfx-ec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHOlcLzyXGAgVnn7_I7IV4sp20kH1gnI5kmo6Wad_g2Q&oe=6A9AD994"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h8S2rCSPmd8Q7kNvwFaD3Wu&_nc_oc=AdpTKONlwiZRu-lt7fVyOe_qnVZWXYaqQx17BUW-a1NTiZx6z9yjBEsR264vuOvRg5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLgRbewE-XDjZ6iFGE0ImXUa8Fww4vob-U9NGa_7IcOAA&oe=6A9AEED3"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco